    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**user_id is a salted hash, and only exists where the salt was set.** The id is `sha256(PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_SALT + \":\" + did)`; a DID is a durable cross-service identifier, so the raw value never leaves the device. A build without the salt emits no `user_id` at all, which reads as *anonymous*: the panel above is empty until the deploy that set it, and every session from before that point stays anonymous in the historical window. Anonymous sessions still count in **Sessions per day**.\n\nThe salt is inlined into the static bundle at build time (`Dockerfile.app-lite`), so rotating the salt starts a new id space and does not retroactively separate old series.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "About user_id",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${DS_LOKI}"
      },
      "description": "Page views per URL over the last 7 days. page_url is Faro session metadata, so a room URL carries the space DID and room id in its path.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Value"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
